<!--
============================================================
== AVEmulator
== (C) 2026 AVEmulator
== ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
== Pandora.xml
== Pandora Event: a single server-wide chest spawns at a
== configurable map/coordinate. Whoever picks it up becomes
== PK-flagged and frozen (slower movement) until either they
== survive SurviveTime minutes uninterrupted (win) or someone
== kills them (chest drops where they died, timer resets, and
== the PK flag/freeze on them is restored/removed).
== Loaded by GameServer via CPandoraEvent::LoadXML(). Enabled
== via the "PandoraEvent" key in GameServerInfo - Event.dat.
== Modify only if you know what you're doing!
============================================================

### Pandora::Location ###
	Map/X/Y  Where the chest spawns when the event starts.

### Pandora::Timing ###
	NotifyTime    Minutes before start that the "event starting soon"
	              announcement fires.
	SurviveTime   Minutes the holder must survive uninterrupted (timer
	              resets to 0 every time the chest changes hands) to
	              win.
	EventTime     Total event duration, minutes. If nobody wins before
	              this runs out, the event just closes - no winner.
	CloseTime     Minutes the event stays in its closing/cleanup phase
	              before the next scheduled run can begin.

### Pandora::Schedule::StartTime ###
	One or more scheduled triggers, matched against the real-world
	clock (-1 = any/wildcard for that field):
	Year/Month/Day/DayOfWeek/Hour/Minute/Second.

### Pandora::Reward ###
	WC/WP/GP           WCoinC/WCoinP/GoblinPoint paid to the winner.
	GensContribution   Gens Family contribution points paid to the
	                   winner, 0 = none.

STRICTLY NO COMMENTS INSIDE TAGS
-->

<PandoraEvent>
	<Location Map="0" X="145" Y="126" />
	<Timing NotifyTime="1" SurviveTime="10" EventTime="30" CloseTime="1" />

	<Schedule>
		<StartTime Year="-1" Month="-1" Day="-1" DayOfWeek="-1" Hour="21" Minute="0" Second="0" />
	</Schedule>

	<Reward WC="0" WP="0" GP="0" GensContribution="0" />
</PandoraEvent>
